 a cafeteria."]]},{"t":"inst","text":"Now answer the questions:"},{"t":"write","below":true,"rowGap":"6px","items":[{"q":"What is this? (house)"},{"q":"What is that? (school)"},{"q":"What is this? (hotel)"},{"q":"What is that? (discotheque)"},{"q":"What is this? (office)"}]},{"t":"part","n":"III","title":"Count the Numbers"},{"t":"img","src":"img/v/l03-numbers.svg","h":"330px"}]}]}